: "#432", "widgets_values": ["minimax_music3_dav.safetensors"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "vae_name"}, "name": "vae_name", "label": "vae_name", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "vae_name"}], "flags": {}, "type": "VAELoader", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [480, 70], "pos": [2630, 1640], "id": 47, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "models": [{"directory_invalid": true, "name": "minimax_music3_dav.safetensors", "directory": "vae", "url": "https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-Music-3/resolve/main/vae/minimax_music3_dav.safetensors"}], "ver": "0.31.0", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.8"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "VAELoader"}, "order": 4}, {"showAdvanced": true, "outputs": [{"name": "CONDITIONING", "links": [68, 70], "label": "CONDITIONING", "type": "CONDITIONING", "localized_name": "CONDITIONING"}, {"name": "seconds", "links": [76], "label": "seconds", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "seconds"}], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["Global Metadata  A hard-hitting futuristic K-pop dance anthem with heavy electronic production — hybrid future-bass drops, glitchy synth arpeggios, industrial mechanical percussion, and a pounding four-on-the-floor club kick. Fast, driving dance tempo with a relentless, adrenaline-charged momentum. The emotional arc is a battle ignition: tense sci-fi anticipation in the verses, surging defiance in the pre-chorus, explosive all-out firepower at the choruses, a sleek dangerous groove in the dance break, and a cathartic, triumphant dawn-like finale. Overall sound is polished, cinematic, glossy yet aggressive — the feeling of five young women strapping into towering battle mechs and lighting up a war-torn sky, equal parts lethal and gorgeous. The mood fuses combat intensity, confident feminine sensuality, and neon-lit deep-space spectacle.  Vocal Details  Five-member female vocal group with clearly distributed roles: a bright, piercing lead vocal with agile, metallic clarity; a lower, smoky alto adding dangerous warmth and sensual undertone; two agile harmony voices stacked in tight, syncopated group chants; and a fierce rap-tone vocal with attitude-laced, half-sung delivery. Verses ride low, breathy, and coiled, almost whispering over the groove before striking. Pre-choruses stack layered harmonies rising in intensity. Choruses explode into unison group belting with gang-vocal war chants, call-and-response English interjections (\"Launch!\", \"We ride, we rise\"), and ad-libs soaring above the drop. The bridge counts the five members one by one in intimate, close-mic delivery before a final half-tempo chest-voiced vow. Backing vocals include vocoded robotic whispers and radio-transmission filtered spoken lines evoking cockpit comms.  Arrangement  Intro (0:00–0:15): radio-static cockpit comms, a rising synth siren, and a heartbeat-pulse bass; whispered system-check vocals glitch into the first downbeat. Verse 1 (0:15–0:45): sparse industrial percussion, rubbery sub-bass, and staccato synth stabs leave space for the low, coiled female delivery; metallic foley hits accent each line. Pre-Chorus (0:45–1:00): filtered synth arpeggios rise, snare rolls tighten, harmonies stack into a breath-held launch countdown. Chorus 1 (1:00–1:30): full drop — thunderous kick, saw-tooth bass riff, triumphant top-line synth melody, gang chants punctuating the hook; wide stereo brass-like synth blasts evoke mechs launching. Post-Hook (1:30–1:45): half-time strut groove with vocal chops and a seductive, swinging bassline. Verse 2 (1:45–2:10): tighter, percussive, rap-flavored groove with glitched vocal fragments. Pre-Chorus 2 (2:10–2:25) and Chorus 2 (2:25–2:55): chorus returns with added octave doubling and ad-lib fireworks. Dance Break (2:55–3:10): beat cuts to a hard electro-house stomp with vocal-chant commands and a rising white-noise sweep. Bridge (3:10–3:30): music strips to heartbeat pulse and piano-like synth bells as the five members are counted out one by one, building into a half-tempo vow. Final Chorus (3:30–3:55): key-lifted, maximum-energy reprise with all harmonies, chants, and ad-libs stacked. Outro (3:55–4:10): engine hum, soft synth starlight pads, a whispered English sign-off, and one last distant mechanical footstep into silence.", "[Intro]\nSystem check — all lights green\n深空在预警 唤醒她们\n(This is our war, this is our song)  [Verse 1]\n合金的心跳 沿着脊椎苏醒\n星图的背面 有深渊在偷听\n别拿獠牙 丈量我们的年龄\n裙摆掀起风暴 也掀起黎明  [Pre-Chorus]\n倒数三秒 引擎压低了呼吸\n把恐惧调成电流 锐利又安静\nIf we burn, we burn like a star\n五道光 汇成同一次心跳  [Chorus]\nLaunch! We are the dawn\n五台钢铁 咆哮着升空\nAim and fire 打穿这长夜\n连深渊都退让 为我们的炽烈\nOne for the thunder, two for the flame\nThree, four, five — 光汇成锋芒\nWe ride, we rise 我们即方向\n星海作证 这一战为家乡  [Post-Hook]\n(Ignite, ignite)\n装甲上的吻痕 是战火的形状\n(Ignite, ignite)\n危险又漂亮 We are the light  [Verse 2]\n失重的座舱里 我数着呼吸\n黑潮扑来 心跳稳得像节拍器\n你说会怕 我说怕也没关系\n把怕意焊进合金 就无懈可击  [Pre-Chorus]\n倒数三秒 引擎压低了呼吸\n把恐惧调成电流 锐利又安静\nIf we burn, we burn like a star\n五道光 汇成同一次心跳  [Chorus]\nLaunch! We are the dawn\n五台钢铁 咆哮着升空\nAim and fire 打穿这长夜\n连深渊都退让 为我们的炽烈\nOne for the thunder, two for the flame\nThree, four, five — 光汇成锋芒\nWe ride, we rise 我们即方向\n星海作证 这一战为家乡  [Dance Break]\nMove — 机甲也是高跟鞋\n踩着低音 巡逻整片星野\nMove — 优雅地结束战斗\n转身留一地 弹壳折的玫瑰  [Bridge]\nOne — 雷电落在她的掌心\nTwo — 火焰划出赤红的轨迹\nThree — 冰棱 Four — 光刃\nFive — 我把她们连成一体\n(We are five, we are one)\n深渊听好 这是少女的宣战书\n你说黑暗无边\n我们就做 黑暗尽头的日出  [Chorus]\nLaunch! We are the dawn\n五台钢铁 咆哮着升空\nAim and fire 打穿这长夜\n连深渊都退让 为我们的炽烈\nOne for the thunder, two for the flame\nThree, four, five — 光汇成锋芒\nWe ride, we rise 我们即方向\n星海作证 这一战为家乡  [Outro]\n烟尘落定 摘下头盔的长发\n星球在脚下 重新学会发芽\nIf tomorrow needs a name\n就叫我们 Five of the dawn\n(We ride, we rise)", 222, "randomize", 120.00000000000003, 1.7, 70], "inputs": [{"name": "clip", "link": 64, "label": "clip", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "clip"}, {"widget": {"name": "caption"}, "name": "caption", "label": "caption", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "caption"}, {"widget": {"n